hint.description:
Short hint rendered under the input (e.g. "Get this from
@BotFather on Telegram"). Plaintext only — never user-supplied
HTML.

delta.description:
`recent - baseline`. Negative for success_rate = worse;
positive for refusal_rate = worse. The `class` field
resolves direction so consumers don't have to.

TestStepOutput.description:
IPC-shaped projection of [`StepOutput`]. Flat for specta;
`output` is a serialized JSON value rather than a recursive
type (matches the executions log pattern).
